<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:00:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>卢拉学校 Trabuco para acalmar 市场</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/lula-escolhe-trabuco-para-acalmar-mercado-video</link><description>玛莎·贝克（Martha Beck）在法森达（Fazenda）的特拉布科（Trabuco）学校获得了卢拉（Lula）的学校。帕特里夏·泽维尔 (Patricia Xavier) 的编辑。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/lula-escolhe-trabuco-para-acalmar-mercado-video'&gt;卢拉学校 Trabuco para acalmar 市场&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Lula escolhe Trabuco para acalmar mercado&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/lula-escolhe-trabuco-para-acalmar-mercado-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:24:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>假期过后风险偏好回升 美股将反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday</link><description>美国股市有望反弹，纳斯达克 100 指数跌至熊市边缘后，风险偏好有所回升。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday'&gt;假期过后风险偏好回升 美股将反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stocks Rebound as Traders Pile Into Battered Tech Shares&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:56:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</link><description>随着投资者重返科技股以及人工智能行业情绪改善，亚洲新兴市场股市预计每周上涨，收复了近期的部分抛售。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing'&gt;随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Emerging-Market Stocks Eye Best Week Since June on Tech Rebound&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</link><description>交易员权衡美联储加息的前景与美国科技股反弹推动的更广泛市场复苏，金价企稳。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week'&gt;美联储利率走势和人工智能股票本周波动较大，金价稳定&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Rises as Rebound in Tech Stocks Helps Revive Risk Appetite&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/gold-steadies-as-fed-rate-path-and-ai-stocks-frame-volatile-week</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:53:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>首次公开募股以来，经历了一周的波动后，Anthropic 股价大幅上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anthropic-shares-jump-after-volatile-first-week-since-record-ipo</link><description>Anthropic PBC 的股价攀升至 83 美元以上的首次公开募股价格之上，这家人工智能实验室希望以积极的表现结束创纪录的首次亮相后在纳斯达克的首个日历周。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anthropic-shares-jump-after-volatile-first-week-since-record-ipo'&gt;首次公开募股以来，经历了一周的波动后，Anthropic 股价大幅上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic Shares Jump After Volatile Week Since IPO&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anthropic-shares-jump-after-volatile-first-week-since-record-ipo</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:49:08 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>